th anyone you want. Pick a spot for your tent, get yourself a campfire going, and start expanding. Store all your valuables inside the tent, which only you can access. Upgrade your research base along 8 different specialization paths to match your playstyle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting</strong> - Instantly combine items at a workbench to create new gear from over 500 unique items in the game. Customize your weapons with attachments and paint your furniture to create your perfect base </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farming</strong> - Grow food for yourself or sell it to make money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cooking</strong> - Experiment with countless ingredient combinations and spices to create unique dishes. Master the art of cuisine and become the island's top chef</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandbox</strong> - Do whatever you want, wherever you want, with whoever you want. There are no rules or tasks. Make the game what you want it to be </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trading</strong> - Sell your knowledge and rare items to other players, set up your own shop to specialize in unique goods, or make steady income from camp vendors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel</strong> - Navigate between islands using your own boat or hunt local wildlife to acquire mounts for exploring different regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dedicated Server tools</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free content updates</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635450/extras/6a37a83f6f6fd2d802f89eff3972db73.poster.avif?t=1740149927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635450/extras/6a37a83f6f6fd2d802f89eff3972db73.webm?t=1740149927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635450/extras/6a37a83f6f6fd2d802f89eff3972db73.mp4?t=1740149927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635450/extras/623e1155fc72f5c13a55e5fde67093dd.poster.avif?t=1740149927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635450/extras/623e1155fc72f5c13a55e5fde67093dd.webm?t=1740149927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635450/extras/623e1155fc72f5c13a55e5fde67093dd.mp4?t=1740149927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
